    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/47a369a66efc04eff43e84392f495231.avif?t=1714513300\" width=501 height=149 /></span><br><br>The leaves of The World's Tree have begun to fall! And you need to get them back!<br><br>Play as Skylark, A flying squirrel who must save The World's Tree from King Murasaki! You must collect all of the Soul Leaves before It's too late! Can you collect them all?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/a7b4b7229f2e310d167155dbd3f464d0.poster.avif?t=1714513300\" width=650 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/a7b4b7229f2e310d167155dbd3f464d0.webm?t=1714513300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/a7b4b7229f2e310d167155dbd3f464d0.mp4?t=1714513300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/798a47a2a0f0e54b87581bcae7b09b3e.avif?t=1714513300\" width=551 height=338 /></span><br>You don't have to go alone though! Have a friend play as Aerial, Skylark's sister in split-screen co-op for twice the fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/ac0de516716428b7f1b1b3ad98d166f3.poster.avif?t=1714513300\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/ac0de516716428b7f1b1b3ad98d166f3.webm?t=1714513300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/ac0de516716428b7f1b1b3ad98d166f3.mp4?t=1714513300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>10 Levels to explore!<br></li><li>Split-Screen Co-op!<br></li><li>In-Depth Movement Options!<br></li><li>Fast-paced Platforming!<br></li><li>Intense Boss Fights!<br></li><li>7 pieces of armor with unique power-ups!<br></li><li>Mini Games and Side Modes!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/47a369a66efc04eff43e84392f495231.avif?t=1714513300\" width=501 height=149 /></span><br><br>The leaves of The World's Tree have begun to fall! And you need to get them back!<br><br>Play as Skylark, A flying squirrel who must save The World's Tree from King Murasaki! You must collect all of the Soul Leaves before It's too late! Can you collect them all?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/a7b4b7229f2e310d167155dbd3f464d0.poster.avif?t=1714513300\" width=650 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/a7b4b7229f2e310d167155dbd3f464d0.webm?t=1714513300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/a7b4b7229f2e310d167155dbd3f464d0.mp4?t=1714513300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/798a47a2a0f0e54b87581bcae7b09b3e.avif?t=1714513300\" width=551 height=338 /></span><br>You don't have to go alone though! Have a friend play as Aerial, Skylark's sister in split-screen co-op for twice the fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/ac0de516716428b7f1b1b3ad98d166f3.poster.avif?t=1714513300\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/ac0de516716428b7f1b1b3ad98d166f3.webm?t=1714513300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960750/extras/ac0de516716428b7f1b1b3ad98d166f3.mp4?t=1714513300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>10 Levels to explore!<br></li><li>Split-Screen Co-op!<br></li><li>In-Depth Movement Options!<br></li><li>Fast-paced Platforming!<br></li><li>Intense Boss Fights!<br></li><li>7 pieces of armor with unique power-ups!<br></li><li>Mini Games and Side Modes!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A 64-bit 3D Collect-a-thon Platformer where you play as A flying squirrel who can glide, run, jump and roll in open non-linear levels collecting Acorns, Soul Leaves and 7 pieces of armor with unique power-ups! You can even play with a friend in Split-Screen Co-op!",
